{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41375","headline":"怀三茅道友 · 熊皎","name":"怀三茅道友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尘事何年解客嘲，十年容易到三茅。\n长思碧洞云窗下，曾借黄庭雪夜抄。\n丹桂有心凭至论，五峰无信问深交。\n杏坛仙侣应相笑，只爲浮名未肯抛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"熊皎","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}